msgstr "حُفظ النموذج المدرّب باسم <i>%1$s</i>."

msgid "The trained model is <b>not</b> saved because the some of the variable names in the model contain spaces (i.e., ' ') or underscores (i.e., '_'). Please remove all such characters from the variable names and try saving the model again."
